    "title": "About the DNSSEC Observatory",
    "what_title": "What is it?",
    "what_text": "The DNSSEC Observatory is a DNS security analysis tool developed by ISOC Ecuador with the support of CORPECE. It allows you to verify the DNSSEC status of .ec domains and get precise technical recommendations.",
